### Alarm -> Push 当前基线请求集
### 权威说明和实测结果：hpis-alarm/doc/报警Push接口测试用例-全新环境.md
### 本文件不包含 pushBindingId、企业微信、工单转派和 messageType=25。

@alarmBaseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:18806
@pushBaseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8812
@receiverBaseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:19010
@rabbitManagementBaseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:15672
@token = replace-with-valid-token
@tenantId = 799001
@userId = 799001
@otherToken = replace-with-other-tenant-token
@otherUserId = 799002
@deviceId = 79900101
@deviceSn = CODEX-E2E-DEVICE-MANUAL
@gatewaySn = CODEX-E2E-GATEWAY-MANUAL
@runId = 20260714225038
@alarmConfigureId = 0
@pushConfigId = 0

### 0. 清空接收器
DELETE {{receiverBaseUrl}}/_events

### AC-01 新增 Alarm 配置（tenantId 即使传入也会被服务端当前租户覆盖）
POST {{alarmBaseUrl}}/configure/add
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
user_id: {{userId}}
username: manual-e2e
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "alarmConfigureName": "e2e-alarm-manual",
  "alarmType": "10",
  "deviceAlarmControl": "1",
  "alarmConfigurePeriod": "0",
  "sceneType": "1",
  "deviceIds": [{{deviceId}}],
  "pushEnabled": "1",
  "pushMessageType": "10",
  "workorderConfigId": 0,
  "tenantId": 1
}

### AC-02 列表；从 rows 回填 alarmConfigureId
GET {{alarmBaseUrl}}/configure/list?pageNum=1&pageSize=100&alarmConfigureName=e2e-alarm-manual
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
user_id: {{userId}}
username: manual-e2e

### AC-03 详情；必须返回 deviceIds/deviceSet
GET {{alarmBaseUrl}}/configure/{{alarmConfigureId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
user_id: {{userId}}
username: manual-e2e

### AC-04 修改；不传 deviceIds=保留，[] = 清空，非空数组=替换
PUT {{alarmBaseUrl}}/configure/update
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
user_id: {{userId}}
username: manual-e2e
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "alarmConfigureId": {{alarmConfigureId}},
  "alarmConfigureName": "e2e-alarm-manual-u",
  "alarmType": "10",
  "deviceAlarmControl": "1",
  "alarmConfigurePeriod": "0",
  "sceneType": "1",
  "deviceIds": [{{deviceId}}],
  "pushEnabled": "1",
  "pushMessageType": "10",
  "workorderConfigId": 0
}

### PC-01 新增禁用的 HTTP Push 配置
POST {{pushBaseUrl}}/pushConfig/add
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
user_id: {{userId}}
username: manual-e2e
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messageType": "10",
  "pushChannelType": "10",
  "enabled": false,
  "pushAddress": "127.0.0.1:19010/codex/alarm-10",
  "isPassive": "0",
  "configName": "e2e-push-manual",
  "deviceSns": ["{{deviceSn}}"],
  "tenantId": 1
}

### PC-02 列表；从 rows 回填 pushConfigId
GET {{pushBaseUrl}}/pushConfig/list?pageNum=1&pageSize=100&configName=e2e-push-manual
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
user_id: {{userId}}
username: manual-e2e

### PC-03 详情
GET {{pushBaseUrl}}/pushConfig/{{pushConfigId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
user_id: {{userId}}
username: manual-e2e

### PC-04 修改并启用
POST {{pushBaseUrl}}/pushConfig/update
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
user_id: {{userId}}
username: manual-e2e
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "activePushConfigId": {{pushConfigId}},
  "messageType": "10",
  "pushChannelType": "10",
  "enabled": true,
  "pushAddress": "127.0.0.1:19010/codex/alarm-10",
  "isPassive": "0",
  "configName": "e2e-push-manual-u",
  "deviceSns": ["{{deviceSn}}"]
}

### AP-01 HTTP 报警入口；当前接口返回空 2xx，以最终接收为准
POST {{alarmBaseUrl}}/alarm/alarmAdd
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
user_id: {{userId}}
username: manual-e2e
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "alarmId": "CODEX-E2E-HTTP-{{runId}}",
  "deviceSn": "{{deviceSn}}",
  "gatewaySn": "{{gatewaySn}}",
  "alarmType": "10",
  "alarmDegree": "1",
  "sceneType": "1",
  "cameraType": "1",
  "tenantId": {{tenantId}},
  "time": "2026-07-14 22:51:08"
}

### AP-02 查询 HTTP 最终接收
GET {{receiverBaseUrl}}/_events

### AP-03 真实 RabbitMQ alarm_queue 消息
### RabbitMQ 管理 API 需要 Basic Auth；payload 内的 cmdSeq 必须是 int。
POST {{rabbitManagementBaseUrl}}/api/exchanges/%2F/amq.default/publish
Authorization: Basic guest guest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "properties": {
    "content_type": "application/json",
    "delivery_mode": 2
  },
  "routing_key": "alarm_queue",
  "payload_encoding": "string",
  "payload": "{\"cmd\":\"dataSync\",\"cmdData\":{\"confItems\":1000,\"deviceSn\":\"{{gatewaySn}}\",\"operCode\":259,\"rawData\":{\"alarmDegree\":\"1\",\"alarmId\":\"CODEX-E2E-MQ-{{runId}}\",\"alarmType\":\"10\",\"cameraType\":\"1\",\"deviceSn\":\"{{deviceSn}}\",\"gatewaySn\":\"{{gatewaySn}}\",\"sceneType\":\"1\",\"time\":\"2026-07-14 22:51:08\"},\"version\":1},\"cmdSeq\":1,\"servId\":\"manual-e2e\",\"times\":1}"
}

### AP-04 再查接收器；计数应比 AP-02 增加 1
GET {{receiverBaseUrl}}/_events

### TI-01 隔离租户查不到 Alarm 配置
GET {{alarmBaseUrl}}/configure/list?pageNum=1&pageSize=100&alarmConfigureName=e2e-alarm-manual
Authorization: Bearer {{otherToken}}
user_id: {{otherUserId}}
username: manual-e2e-other

### TI-02 隔离租户查不到 Push 配置
GET {{pushBaseUrl}}/pushConfig/list?pageNum=1&pageSize=100&configName=e2e-push-manual
Authorization: Bearer {{otherToken}}
user_id: {{otherUserId}}
username: manual-e2e-other

### PC-05 禁用；执行后再发一条新报警，接收器计数不得增加
POST {{pushBaseUrl}}/pushConfig/update
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
user_id: {{userId}}
username: manual-e2e
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "activePushConfigId": {{pushConfigId}},
  "messageType": "10",
  "pushChannelType": "10",
  "enabled": false,
  "pushAddress": "127.0.0.1:19010/codex/alarm-10",
  "isPassive": "0",
  "configName": "e2e-push-manual-u",
  "deviceSns": ["{{deviceSn}}"]
}

### PC-06 API 删除 Push 配置
DELETE {{pushBaseUrl}}/pushConfig/{{pushConfigId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
user_id: {{userId}}
username: manual-e2e

### PC-07 删除后详情必须 data=null
GET {{pushBaseUrl}}/pushConfig/{{pushConfigId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
user_id: {{userId}}
username: manual-e2e

### AC-05 API 删除 Alarm 配置
DELETE {{alarmBaseUrl}}/configure/delete/{{alarmConfigureId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
user_id: {{userId}}
username: manual-e2e

### AC-06 删除后详情必须 data=null
GET {{alarmBaseUrl}}/configure/{{alarmConfigureId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
user_id: {{userId}}
username: manual-e2e

### 最后清空接收器
DELETE {{receiverBaseUrl}}/_events
